WEBVTT

00:00:43.497 --> 00:00:45.540
I'm ready to die.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:29.251
The Resurrection Stone.

00:01:58.905 --> 00:02:02.284
You've been so brave, sweetheart.

00:02:06.371 --> 00:02:08.248
Why are you here?

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.834
All of you?

00:02:13.211 --> 00:02:15.380
We never left.

00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:25.849
Does it--?

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:27.767
Does it hurt?

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:30.520
Dying?

00:02:31.438 --> 00:02:33.982
Quicker than falling asleep.

00:02:37.903 --> 00:02:40.322
You're nearly there, son.

00:02:40.363 --> 00:02:41.698
HARRY:
I'm sorry.

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:45.243
I never wanted any of you to die for me.

00:02:46.828 --> 00:02:48.580
And, Remus, your son....

00:02:48.622 --> 00:02:53.001
Others will tell him
what his mother and father died for.

00:02:53.043 --> 00:02:56.505
One day, he'll understand.

00:03:08.266 --> 00:03:09.809
You'll stay with me?

00:03:11.353 --> 00:03:13.647
Until the end.

00:03:14.314 --> 00:03:16.441
And he won't be able to see you?

00:03:16.483 --> 00:03:18.151
SIRIUS:
No.

00:03:19.444 --> 00:03:22.030
We're here, you see.

00:03:36.586 --> 00:03:38.630
Stay close to me.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.509
Always.

00:03:57.274 --> 00:04:01.027
DEATH EATER:
No sign of him, my Lord.

00:04:16.459 --> 00:04:19.212
VOLDEMORT:
I thought he would come.

00:05:00.086 --> 00:05:03.882
Harry? No! What are you doing here?

00:05:03.923 --> 00:05:05.216
Quiet!

00:05:16.227 --> 00:05:18.480
Harry Potter.

00:05:21.608 --> 00:05:24.277
The Boy Who Lived.

00:05:28.531 --> 00:05:30.950
Come to die.

00:05:49.177 --> 00:05:50.887
Avada Kedavra!

